<title>UK: Novorossiisk pipeline repair set for Apr 8 - sourc.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk pipeline repair set for Apr 8 - sourc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The main crude pipeline feeding Russia's main oil export terminal of Novorossiisk will close for about 80 hours for scheduled maintenance starting on April 8, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>Some disruption to loadings could be expected for about two days during the work, the source said.</p>
<p>The pipeline has a capacity of about 600,000 barrels per day. It was shut for maintenance for around 74 hours early last month.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
